<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-overlay"></div><div class="container hero-inner"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Premium Properties · Trusted Advice</div><h1>Real Estate –<br/>Made Simple</h1><h2>Honest &amp; Transparent Advice</h2><p class="coverage">Gurgaon &nbsp;|&nbsp; New Delhi &amp; NCR &nbsp;|&nbsp; Jaipur &nbsp;|&nbsp; Himachal &nbsp;|&nbsp; Goa &nbsp;|&nbsp; Dubai</p><p class="market-line">Residential &nbsp;|&nbsp; Commercial &nbsp;|&nbsp; Plots &nbsp;|&nbsp; New Projects &nbsp;|&nbsp; Investments</p></div><div class="hero-trust"><b>20+ YEARS</b><span>OF TRUST</span><span>IN GURGAON</span></div></div></section><section class="benefit-strip"><div class="container benefit-grid"><div class="benefit"><div aria-hidden="true" class="benefit-icon"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19V5h16v14M8 9h2m4 0h2M8 13h2m4 0h2M8 17h8"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Data-Driven Decisions</h3><p>Market intelligence to help you buy, sell and invest with confidence.</p></div></div><div class="benefit"><div aria-hidden="true" class="benefit-icon"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.7-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.3-7-10V6l7-3zM9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Honest &amp; Transparent Advice</h3><p>Clear guidance, realistic pricing and straightforward communication.</p></div></div><div class="benefit"><div aria-hidden="true" class="benefit-icon"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21a9 9 0 1 0-9-9 9 9 0 0 0 9 9zM8 12h8M12 8v8"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Personalised Gurgaon Support</h3><p>Local expertise and hands-on support from shortlist to completion.</p></div></div><div class="benefit"><div aria-hidden="true" class="benefit-icon"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h16M4 12l4-4m-4 4 4 4M20 12l-4-4m4 4-4 4"></path></svg></div><div><h3>End-to-End Assistance</h3><p>Support across search, negotiation, documentation and closing.</p></div></div></div></section><div class="search-stack"><section aria-label="Keyword property search" class="keyword-search"><div class="keyword-head"><div><div class="keyword-eyebrow">Search Your Way</div><h3>Looking for something specific?</h3><p>Try a keyword — or tap a suggestion below.</p></div><div class="keyword-input-wrap"><input autocomplete="off" id="home-keyword-input" name="keyword" placeholder="Search by keyword: corner, park facing, DLF, 60 metre road…"/><button aria-label="Search keyword" class="keyword-search-submit" type="button">Search</button><button aria-label="Clear keyword search" class="keyword-clear" type="button">Clear</button></div></div><div class="keyword-chips" data-keyword-chips=""><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Distress" type="button">Distress</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Corner" type="button">Corner</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Park Facing" type="button">Park Facing</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="East Facing" type="button">East Facing</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="60 metre road" type="button">60 Metre Road</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="18 metre road" type="button">18 Metre Road</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Residential" type="button">Residential</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Commercial" type="button">Commercial</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Industrial" type="button">Industrial</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Plots" type="button">Plots</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="DLF" type="button">DLF</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Manesar" type="button">Manesar</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Sohna" type="button">Sohna</button><button class="keyword-chip" data-keyword="Dwarka Expressway" type="button">Dwarka Expressway</button></div></section><section aria-label="Property search" class="search"><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" type="button">Buy</button><button class="tab" type="button">Rent</button><button class="tab" type="button">Commercial</button><button class="tab" type="button">Plot &amp; Land</button></div><form class="fields" data-target="properties/index.html" id="home-search-form"><input name="mode" type="hidden" value="buy"/><select class="field" data-search-location="" name="location"><option value="">Select Location</option></select><select class="field" data-search-type="" name="type"><option value="">Property Type</option></select><select class="field" name="size"><option value="">BHK / Size</option><option>2 BHK</option><option>3 BHK</option><option>4 BHK</option><option>5 BHK+</option><option>Plot / Land</option><option>Commercial Size</option></select><select class="field" name="budget"><option value="">Budget</option><option value="1 Cr">Up to ₹1 Cr</option><option value="2 Cr">Up to ₹2 Cr</option><option value="3 Cr">Up to ₹3 Cr</option><option value="5 Cr">Up to ₹5 Cr</option><option value="10 Cr">Up to ₹10 Cr</option><option value="20 Cr">Up to ₹20 Cr</option></select><button type="submit">⌕   Search</button></form></section></div></section>
